// Golden lockstep replay: a real battle on the shipped default arena, with the world
// checksum recorded every `checkpoint_interval` ticks.
//
// Every target (Linux, Windows, macOS ARM64, wasm32-wasip1) replays this script and must
// reproduce `checksums` exactly. A simulation change that alters behaviour updates this
// list in the commit that explains why. See tests/golden_replay_tests.rs.
